/-
Flat5Data.lean — data of the 5-qubit configuration X₄₉₆ (blueprint 11, TIGHT-1 examples;
`certificates/flat5_496.json`).

Labels are bit-packed Nats < 1024: a = x | (z << 5), qubit i ↔ bit i (x) and bit 5+i (z),
P_a = i^{x·z} X^x Z^z.  `x496` lists the 496 points; `neg496` lists the points where the witness
assignment g = sign⟨ψ|P_a|ψ⟩ of the (numerical) flat state ψ is −1.
Imports only Lean core.  Nothing about how the data was produced matters for soundness: the Lean
side recounts the lines and the violated lines.
-/

